{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 1, "text": "布依族文化大观", "bbox_px": {"x": 736, "y": 169, "w": 289, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族文化大观", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 736, "y": 169, "w": 289, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 2, "text": "穿对襟便服，除头帕保留外，衣裤与当地汉族基本相同。目前布依族男青年服饰多为汉", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 274, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "穿对襟便服，除头帕保留外，衣裤与当地汉族基本相同。目前布依族男青年服饰多为汉", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 274, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 3, "text": "装，但在较为偏僻的布依族聚居区，如兴义巴结、惠水长安、贞丰沙坪等偏远地方，布依族", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 338, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "装，但在较为偏僻的布依族聚居区，如兴义巴结、惠水长安、贞丰沙坪等偏远地方，布依族", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 338, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 4, "text": "男子都还保留有自己的民族服饰：靛蓝和白色的布扣有领对襟短衣，靛蓝长裤，布底鞋，", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 406, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "男子都还保留有自己的民族服饰：靛蓝和白色的布扣有领对襟短衣，靛蓝长裤，布底鞋，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 406, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 5, "text": "头包格子帕，尤其在逢年过节、走亲访友之时需要穿戴整齐。", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 471, "w": 1049, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "头包格子帕，尤其在逢年过节、走亲访友之时需要穿戴整齐。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 471, "w": 1049, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 6, "text": "（二）女装", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 539, "w": 177, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（二）女装", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 539, "w": 177, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 7, "text": "布依族女装服饰较为多样，总体上看，保留至今的主要有“上衣下裙”和“上衣下裤”", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 599, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族女装服饰较为多样，总体上看，保留至今的主要有“上衣下裙”和“上衣下裤”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 599, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 8, "text": "两种式样。“上衣下裙”为上穿斜襟短衣或对襟短衣，下穿百褶裙，腰间系素色长围腰；一", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 664, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "两种式样。“上衣下裙”为上穿斜襟短衣或对襟短衣，下穿百褶裙，腰间系素色长围腰；一", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 664, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 9, "text": "种是上穿斜襟短衣（或斜襟中长衣），下着大裤脚，胸前系绣花围腰。斜襟上衣分无领和", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 732, "w": 1544, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "种是上穿斜襟短衣（或斜襟中长衣），下着大裤脚，胸前系绣花围腰。斜襟上衣分无领和", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 732, "w": 1544, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 10, "text": "有领两种。头饰基本上都还包土布头帕，只是各地的包法不一样。传统服饰上脚穿自制", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 797, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有领两种。头饰基本上都还包土布头帕，只是各地的包法不一样。传统服饰上脚穿自制", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 797, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 11, "text": "布底绣花鞋，现在穿绣花鞋的较少了，多数改为市面上出售的胶鞋、皮鞋等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 861, "w": 1311, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布底绣花鞋，现在穿绣花鞋的较少了，多数改为市面上出售的胶鞋、皮鞋等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 861, "w": 1311, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 12, "text": "1. 上衣下裙", "bbox_px": {"x": 1186, "y": 925, "w": 217, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "1. 上衣下裙", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1186, "y": 925, "w": 217, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 13, "text": "明清时期，布依族地区妇", "bbox_px": {"x": 1190, "y": 990, "w": 462, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "明清时期，布依族地区妇", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1190, "y": 990, "w": 462, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 14, "text": "女着裙装仍很普遍，直至20世", "bbox_px": {"x": 1106, "y": 1054, "w": 551, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "女着裙装仍很普遍，直至20世", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1106, "y": 1054, "w": 551, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 15, "text": "纪50年代初，才逐渐改为裤装。", "bbox_px": {"x": 1106, "y": 1118, "w": 555, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "纪50年代初，才逐渐改为裤装。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1106, "y": 1118, "w": 555, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 16, "text": "目前日常生活中还保留穿裙装", "bbox_px": {"x": 1110, "y": 1183, "w": 547, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "目前日常生活中还保留穿裙装", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1110, "y": 1183, "w": 547, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 206, "line_no": 17, "text": "的妇女，主要居住在镇宁布依", "bbox_px": {"x": 1106, "y": 1247, "w": 551, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的妇女，主要居住在镇宁布依", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1106, "y": 1247, "w": 551, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
